{"id":"taormina","name":"陶尔米纳","en":"Taormina","country":"Italy","lat":37.8518,"lng":15.2857,"dek":"海崖上的剧场，火山下的旧城","history":"陶尔米纳的历史从希腊人开始。公元前四世纪，来自纳克索斯的殖民者在这片俯瞰爱奥尼亚海的山坡上建城，城名来源已不可考。公元前三世纪，罗马人取得西西里，陶尔米纳归入帝国版图，山坡上开始出现砖石砌成的剧场与浴场。\n\n中世纪时，阿拉伯人统治过这里，城中的科尔瓦亚宫主体便是一座阿拉伯式塔楼，内院仍留着那时的格局。此后诺曼人、日耳曼人相继而来，山城在不断的易手中缓慢生长，教堂一座接一座建起。\n\n十九世纪末，英国人来到陶尔米纳。佛罗伦萨·特里维廉在此定居，买下海边的小岛，又在山坡上辟出一座花园。画家罗伯特·霍索恩·基特森在1905年建起库塞尼之家，请人绘制壁画、打制家具。此后的一个世纪里，作家与艺术家陆续住进这座山城，陶尔米纳逐渐成为西西里最负盛名的度假地之一。","culture":"陶尔米纳的文化气质里，风景与舞台始终交织。山坡最高处的古代剧场依崖而建，观众席背后是海与火山，古人看戏时望见的正是这片景色。剧场后来用罗马砖石重修，舞台后壁留存至今，在同类遗址中并不多见。\n\n另一重文化来自外来者的驻足。英国人在此留下花园与宅邸，库塞尼之家后来由基特森的侄女达芙妮·费尔普斯经营成客栈，罗素、达尔、田纳西·威廉斯都曾在此下榻。本地生活与外来目光叠在一起，使这座小城既有西西里的底色，也有一层说不清的异乡气息。","pull":"戏台背后，是海与火山的座席。","sights":[{"name":"陶尔米纳古代剧场","orig":"Teatro Antico di Taormina","intro":"山坡最高处的露天剧场，希腊人始建，罗马人后来用砖石重修。观众席顺着山势展开，舞台后壁的残墙仍立着，透过缺口能望见海与埃特纳火山。剧场至今仍用于演出，夏夜坐进石阶，能感到古人选址的眼光。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Taormina-Teatro_Greco01.JPG/960px-Taormina-Teatro_Greco01.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%B6%E7%88%BE%E7%B1%B3%E7%B4%8D%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%A3%E5%8A%87%E5%A0%B4"},{"name":"四月九日广场","orig":"Piazza IX Aprile","intro":"山城中心的一处开阔平台，一侧临海，铺着黑白石砖。广场边上立着钟楼，栏杆外是层层叠叠的屋顶与远处海湾。这里既是本地人歇脚的地方，也是望向爱奥尼亚海与火山的观景台，黄昏时人尤其多。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Aerial_image_of_the_coast_of_Taormina_%28view_from_the_southeast%29.jpg/960px-Aerial_image_of_the_coast_of_Taormina_%28view_from_the_southeast%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taormina"},{"name":"科尔瓦亚宫","orig":"Palazzo Corvaja","intro":"十世纪阿拉伯人统治时期留下的宫殿，主体是一座方正的塔楼，内院回廊间仍能看出阿拉伯建筑的影响。后来这里成为市政机构所在，如今常作展览与会议之用。它就在主干道旁，容易被路人忽略，却是城中少见的早期遗构。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Palazzo_Corvaja.jpg/960px-Palazzo_Corvaja.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1444},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_Corvaja"},{"name":"美丽岛","orig":"Isola Bella","intro":"山脚海边的一座小岛，靠一条窄窄的沙洲与陆地相连，退潮时可以走过去。岛上曾属英国人特里维廉，如今是自然保护区，有小型博物馆与茂密植被。海滩是火山砾石，从山上望下去，海水的蓝色层次分明。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Isola_Bella_and_Mazzaro_bay_at_sunset%2C_Taormina%2C_Sicily%2C_2018.jpg/960px-Isola_Bella_and_Mazzaro_bay_at_sunset%2C_Taormina%2C_Sicily%2C_2018.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":641},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E4%B8%BD%E5%B2%9B_(%E9%99%B6%E5%B0%94%E7%B1%B3%E7%BA%B3)"},{"name":"公爵花园","orig":"Parco Duca di Cesarò","intro":"城边的一处公共园林，由英国人佛罗伦萨·特里维廉在十九世纪末辟建。园中种着地中海与异域植物，散落着几座造型奇特的砖砌小亭，像是要塌下来又始终没塌。这里安静少人，树影间能望见海，适合走累了停下来。","img":null,"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taormina"}],"foods":[{"name":"西西里刨冰","orig":"Granita siciliana","intro":"用糖水与果泥冻成的粗冰沙，质地比雪酪更颗粒，入口即化。西西里人早上常配一只布里欧修面包吃，把它掰开蘸着冰沙。陶尔米纳的咖啡馆多以此消暑，柠檬、杏仁与咖啡口味最寻常。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Granita_originelle_au_citron_de_Sicile.jpg/960px-Granita_originelle_au_citron_de_Sicile.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granita"},{"name":"卡诺里","orig":"Cannolo siciliano","intro":"油炸的脆皮圆筒，临吃前才填入乳清干酪，两端常撒开心果碎或巧克力。皮要脆、馅要凉，填早了皮就会软掉。西西里各处糕点铺都有，陶尔米纳的老城甜点店也不例外，适合配一杯浓缩咖啡。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/Cannolo_siciliano_with_chocolate_squares.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":647},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E8%AB%BE%E9%87%8C"},{"name":"西西里炸饭团","orig":"Arancino","intro":"裹面包糠油炸的米饭团，内里包肉酱、豌豆或奶酪，形似橙子，外脆内软。这是西西里街头最常见的咸点，趁热吃最好。东部一带多做成尖头形，陶尔米纳的小食店里常能买到，适合当路上充饥的一口。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Arancini_002.jpg/960px-Arancini_002.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":718},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arancini"},{"name":"茄子千层","orig":"Parmigiana di melanzane","intro":"茄子切片油煎后，与番茄酱、罗勒和奶酪层层叠起烤成，出炉时奶酪拉着丝，茄子软得几乎化开。这是西西里家常菜的代表，凉了也好吃。陶尔米纳的本地餐馆多把它作为前菜或配菜，分量往往不小。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Parmigiana_di_melanzane.jpg/960px-Parmigiana_di_melanzane.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parmigiana"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Taormina_BW_2012-10-05_16-15-42.jpg/1280px-Taormina_BW_2012-10-05_16-15-42.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":860},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/Sicilia_Taormina4_tango7174.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[15.2233146,37.8475807],[15.223905,37.8452045],[15.2272895,37.8420235],[15.2297961,37.8370522],[15.2303891,37.8330944],[15.2333233,37.8288519],[15.2381541,37.8254038],[15.239722,37.8219272],[15.2465073,37.8177288],[15.2475429,37.8181597],[15.2490308,37.8224877],[15.2548025,37.8240884],[15.259278,37.8269392],[15.2580491,37.8279223],[15.2603357,37.829404],[15.2602022,37.8332005],[15.2685502,37.8399932],[15.2696015,37.844776],[15.2719722,37.8452685],[15.2743971,37.8444821],[15.2763659,37.8466764],[15.2807246,37.8426857],[15.2859086,37.8474895],[15.2885757,37.8480088],[15.2930675,37.8473176],[15.29829,37.8441436],[15.2969948,37.8499271],[15.2992194,37.8510641],[15.3010938,37.8496801],[15.301445,37.8504015],[15.2996099,37.8514711],[15.3007379,37.8529905],[15.302158,37.8522043],[15.3032821,37.8529421],[15.3041321,37.8517185],[15.3054033,37.851575],[15.3056733,37.8523299],[15.3041372,37.8544139],[15.3015976,37.8544285],[15.3014973,37.8560309],[15.3031432,37.8565031],[15.3021517,37.8578317],[15.2976493,37.8589823],[15.2966503,37.8609726],[15.2977037,37.8656543],[15.3041857,37.8754907],[15.2927676,37.8781055],[15.2905951,37.8760413],[15.2882419,37.8758013],[15.2893893,37.874492],[15.2875466,37.8731931],[15.2889798,37.8714169],[15.2883723,37.8664269],[15.2820429,37.8625833],[15.2818453,37.857705],[15.2709358,37.8536781],[15.2713528,37.8520157],[15.2692097,37.8512724],[15.2675466,37.8469815],[15.263899,37.8468797],[15.2628006,37.8456597],[15.2604574,37.8462184],[15.2590494,37.8453231],[15.254972,37.8475964],[15.2497782,37.8448461],[15.2491713,37.8423177],[15.2377831,37.8466255],[15.2344634,37.8448152],[15.230966,37.8463672],[15.2285897,37.8456612],[15.2233146,37.8475807]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"陶尔米纳","en":"Taormina","voyage":"Taormina"}}}